    { q: "Do I have to press the \"H\" toggle every time?", a: "You arm it per module. If a hotkey is tied to a chart or DOM, that panel needs its \"H\" toggle switched on before the shortcut fires. The keyboard icon next to the contract symbol is your tell that hotkeys are live there." },
